duckdb-go-pure
==============

This module is a pure-Go build of DuckDB. Credits:

- DuckDB (https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb), Copyright 2018-2025 Stichting
  DuckDB Foundation, MIT license. The engine embedded in
  internal/duckdbcore is DuckDB v1.5.3 with the core_functions, json and icu
  extensions statically linked, compiled to WebAssembly with Emscripten.
- ICU (https://icu.unicode.org/), Copyright 1991-2020 Unicode, Inc., ICU
  license — bundled via DuckDB's icu extension. See LICENSE.
- wasm2go (https://github.com/ncruces/wasm2go) by Nuno Cruces — the
  WebAssembly-to-Go transpiler that produced internal/duckdbcore, and
  https://github.com/ncruces/go-sqlite3 for pioneering the approach this
  module follows.
- duckdb-wasm2go-poc (https://github.com/esilver/duckdb-wasm2go-poc) — the
  proof-of-concept repository this module was extracted from; it contains the
  full wasm build pipeline used to regenerate the engine.
